# Smoke test: the title, a new game, flight, teleport, a creature and a ship up close
until title 2400
shot title
newgame
shot flight_start
god on
steer 0.6 0 60
shot turned
boost 90
wait 100
shot boosted
teleport 16                 # Wagoll, 99%
until station 1800
shot station
depart
until flight 14000
wait 120
shot wagoll_flight
pin creature 1500
wait 10
shot creature_close
pin ship 2500
wait 10
shot ship_close
pin off
